{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04009","headline":"晦日重宴 · 高峤","name":"晦日重宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"驾言寻凤侣，乘欢俯雁池。\n班荆逢旧识，斟桂喜深知。\n紫兰方出径，黄莺未啭枝。\n别有陶春日，青天云雾披。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高峤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04009.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04009","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}